title: qt text: QTextEdit, QPlainTextEdit, QTextDocument, QTextCursor, formats, syntax highlighting (pyside6)
url:   https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtGui/QTextDocument.html
tags:  qt pyside6 text editor qtextedit qplaintextedit qtextbrowser qtextdocument qtextcursor format highlight syntax markdown html find replace code-editor

## pick the widget
QPlainTextEdit                      # plain text, fast for big files, logs, code editors  @plain @code @log  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QPlainTextEdit.html>
QTextEdit                           # rich text: HTML subset, Markdown, images, tables, lists  @rich @html  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html>
QTextBrowser                        # read-only QTextEdit with clickable links and back/forward history (help viewers)  @browser @help  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextBrowser.html>
QLabel                              # short static rich text; no scrolling or editing  @label  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QLabel.html>

## content
te.setPlainText(S) / te.toPlainText()  # set / get plain text  @text @value  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setPlainText>
te.setHtml(H) / te.toHtml()         # set / get HTML (Qt supports a subset of HTML 4 + CSS)  @html  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setHtml>
te.setMarkdown(M) / te.toMarkdown()  # set / get Markdown (CommonMark + GitHub tables/tasks)  @markdown  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setMarkdown>
te.append("line")                   # add a paragraph at the end (rich text aware)  @append @log  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.append>
te.insertPlainText(S) / te.insertHtml(H)  # insert at the cursor  @insert  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.insertPlainText>
te.clear()                          # remove all content  @clear  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.clear>
te.setPlaceholderText("Type here...")  # grey hint text while empty  @placeholder  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setPlaceholderText>
te.setReadOnly(True)                # make a viewer  @readonly  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setReadOnly>
te.setAcceptRichText(False)         # paste only plain text into a QTextEdit  @paste  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setAcceptRichText>
te.setLineWrapMode(QTextEdit.LineWrapMode.NoWrap)  # turn off wrapping (WidgetWidth default, FixedColumnWidth)  @wrap  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setLineWrapMode>
te.setWordWrapMode(QTextOption.WrapMode.WrapAnywhere)  # wrap inside long words too  @wrap  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setWordWrapMode>
te.setTabStopDistance(QFontMetricsF(te.font()).horizontalAdvance(" ") * 4)  # set tab width to 4 spaces  @tab @indent  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setTabStopDistance>
te.setTabChangesFocus(True)         # make Tab move focus instead of inserting a tab  @tab  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setTabChangesFocus>
te.zoomIn(N) / te.zoomOut(N)        # change the font size  @zoom  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.zoomIn>
te.setUndoRedoEnabled(False)        # turn off undo (saves memory for logs)  @undo  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.setUndoRedoEnabled>
te.undo() / te.redo() / te.copy() / te.cut() / te.paste() / te.selectAll()  # edit commands  @edit  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.undo>
te.textChanged / cursorPositionChanged / selectionChanged / undoAvailable / copyAvailable  # editor signals  @signal  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QTextEdit.cursorPositionChanged>
te.document().setModified(False); te.document().modificationChanged.connect(self.setWindowModified)  # track unsaved changes  @dirty @modified  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtGui/QTextDocument.html#PySide6.QtGui.QTextDocument.modificationChanged>
pte.appendPlainText(LINE) / pte.setMaximumBlockCount(N)  # fast log view that keeps the last N lines  @log  <https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/PySide6/QtWidgets/QPlainTextEdit.html#PySide6.QtWidgets.QPlainTextEdit.appendPlainText>
